    <bpmn:process id="W_W1354" name="W1354. Store Daily Cash Deposit Preparation, Armored Car Pickup &amp; Bank Credit Reconciliation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Store end-of-day cash count and Z-report completion (W574)
Frequency: Daily per store (200 stores × 365 days = 73,000 deposits/year)
Volume: Average cash sales ~42% of PHP 25M/store/month = ~PHP 10.5M cash/store/month; daily cash deposit ~PHP 350,000/store/day
Owner: Store Manager
Participants: Cashier (cash count), Store Manager (deposit preparation), Armored Car Service, Treasury Analyst (bank credit reconciliation)
Source: workflow W1354 — Store Daily Cash Deposit Preparation, Armored Car Pickup &amp; Bank Credit Reconciliation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1354_LaneSet6">
