    <bpmn:process id="W_W1425" name="W1425. Multi-Tender POS Transaction Daily Reconciliation, Settlement Matching &amp; Variance Resolution" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Store end-of-day (EOD) close; daily settlement files from payment processors, card acquirers, and e-wallet providers
Frequency: Daily per store (200 stores); consolidated at HQ by next business day
Volume: ~2.8M POS transactions/month = ~93,000/day across 200 stores; split across cash (42%), card (36%), e-wallet (15%), corporate/charge (5%), returns/exchanges (~2% per profile §5)
Owner: AR Supervisor (HQ); Store Manager (store-level)
Participants: Store Manager, Cashier, AR Supervisor, Treasury Analyst, Card Acquirer Operations, E-Wallet Provider Operations
Source: workflow W1425 — Multi-Tender POS Transaction Daily Reconciliation, Settlement Matching &amp; Variance Resolution</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1425_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1425_Lane1" name="Cashier">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1425_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1425_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1425_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1425_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1425_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1425_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1425_Lane3" name="Treasury Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1425_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1425_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1425_Start5" name="Store end-of-day (EOD) close; daily settlement files from payment processors, card…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1425_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1425_Task6" name="Store-level EOD cash reconciliation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Store-level EOD cash reconciliation (at store close): per W541 (cash office operations): (a) count physical cash in each drawer vs. POS Z-report cash total, (b) verify cash drawer count: starting float + cash sales − cash refunds − cash drops = ending cash, (c) record variance (over/short) per W272, (d) prepare bank deposit per W541
Responsible (R): Cashier / Store Manager
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 15–20 min/store/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1425_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1425_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1425_Task7" name="Card settlement reconciliation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Card settlement reconciliation (T+1): (a) system matches POS card transaction records against card acquirer settlement file (received T+1 morning): (i) match by terminal ID, transaction reference, and amount, (ii) identify unmatched: POS shows card transaction but no acquirer settlement (possible terminal communication failure — transaction approved locally but not captured by acquirer), (iii) identify variances: settlement amount ≠ POS amount (possible partial refund not processed, currency rounding), (b) AR Supervisor investigates exceptions &gt; PHP 500 per transaction
Responsible (R): System / AR Supervisor
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 1–2 hours/day (HQ)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1425_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1425_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1425_Task8" name="E-wallet settlement reconciliation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: E-wallet settlement reconciliation (T+1): (a) system matches POS e-wallet transaction records against GCash/Maya settlement files per W1268: (i) match by QR code transaction reference and amount, (ii) identify unmatched transactions: POS shows e-wallet payment but no settlement (customer QR scan succeeded at POS but payment failed on e-wallet side — rare but happens with poor connectivity), (iii) identify timing differences: e-wallet settlements batched at end of day — some transactions may settle T+2, (b) AR Supervisor follows up on unmatched transactions &gt; PHP 500
Responsible (R): System / AR Supervisor
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 1–2 hours/day (HQ)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1425_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1425_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1425_Task9" name="Corporate/charge account reconciliation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Corporate/charge account reconciliation (T+0 to T+1): (a) POS corporate/charge transactions automatically create AR invoices per W16 (order-to-cash): (i) match customer account number to POS transaction, (ii) verify credit limit compliance per W24, (iii) post AR invoice: Dr. Accounts Receivable / Cr. Revenue, (b) reconciliation: total corporate/charge per POS Z-report vs. total AR invoices posted — must match exactly
Responsible (R): System / AR Clerk
Accountable (A): AR Supervisor
Duration: 30 min/day (HQ)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1425_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1425_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1425_Task10" name="HQ consolidated daily settlement report">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: HQ consolidated daily settlement report: (a) Treasury Analyst prepares daily settlement summary: (i) total POS revenue (all tenders) from 200 stores, (ii) total cash collected (deposited at bank per W541), (iii) total card settlements received, (iv) total e-wallet settlements received, (v) total corporate/charge invoiced, (vi) total loyalty points redeemed (points liability increase), (vii) total revenue per GL = sum of all settlement channels, (b) identify and escalate: (i) stores with cash variance &gt; PHP 1,000 for 2+ consecutive days (LP investigation per W562), (ii) card settlement discrepancies &gt; PHP 10,000 total per store (possible terminal fraud), (iii) e-wallet unreconciled transactions &gt; 5 per store per day (connectivity issue)
Responsible (R): Treasury Analyst
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 1–2 hours/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1425_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1425_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1425_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1425_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1425_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-184 (ensure POS settlement &amp; tender reconciliation completeness.) | - operational: AR Supervisor (HQ); Store Manager (store-level) review and approval gate; operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: AR Supervisor (HQ); Store Manager (store-level)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1425_Assoc13" sourceRef="W1425_Annotation12" targetRef="W1425_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
